    "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#constructing-the-form-data-set\n\n> _Loop_: For each element _field_ in _controls_, in tree order, run the following substeps:\n> 1. If any of the following conditions are met, then skip these substeps for this element:\n>    - The _field_ element is a button but it is not _submitter_.\n\nSo the spec says to omit buttons that didn't cause the submit, as far as I can tell. Or did I miss something in the spec?\n",
